Blobfish (Wondering): *Yaaawn* Leaving this place?
MC (Confused): I guess...not sure what's going on
Blobfish (Happy): Ooooh well, I can come with you through these tides!
- Reject
	Blobfish (Sad): Awww
	Blobfish (Wondering): Gooood luuck, I'll find my way!
- Accept
	Blobfish (Happy): Yaaay!
	Blobfish (Happy): Let's find some good homes
	MC (Happy): Sure!
	[signal arg="Follow"]
